

Pulogalamu yeretsa.


>> Veggy := Chinthu chatsopano.
Veggy chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: {
	>> v := wekha chatsopano.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy chikafika: ['init'] chitani: { zake veggies := 0. }.

Veggy chikafika: ['carrots:'] chitani: { :a zake veggies := a. <- Palibe. }.
Veggy chikafika: ['carrots'] chitani: { <- zake veggies. }.
Veggy chikafika: ['+'] chitani: { :f
	>> n := Veggy chatsopano.
	n carrots: (f carrots + zake veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy chikafika: ['malemba-a-mawu'] chitani: { <- zake veggies malemba-a-mawu.
}.

Nambala chikafika: ['carrots'] chitani: {
	>> x := Veggy chatsopano.
	x carrots: wekha. <- x.
}.

Nambala chikafika: ['add:and:'] chitani: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Zotuluka lembani: q, mzere-watsopano.
